                        <TextBlock Text="Hold an uncertain mapping for review (no transcript read, no guessed zone)" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,22,0,0" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,4,0,0" Foreground="#FF6B7280"
                                   Text="Name the source ID and the locator file of the source whose zone or format you cannot yet resolve. The service holds the submission in the private quarantine without opening its transcript and without defaulting a zone; only your explicit resolution (enroll once known, or withdraw here) clears it. The locator travels only in this request and is never echoed back." />
                        <Grid Margin="0,10,0,0">
