                        </StackPanel>

                        <TextBlock Text="Scope and limits of this view" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,20,0,6" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,2"
                                   Text="• Enrollment is always explicit: a source enrolls with the zone, format and version you state, and an uncertain mapping is held for review instead of guessed into a default zone. Nothing here enrolls by itself." />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,2"
                                   Text="• A held mapping was never read: its transcript stays untouched until you enroll it with a known mapping, and withdrawing it enrolls nothing." />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,2"
                                   Text="• An unregistered format is the service's explicit unsupported diagnostic, never a silent best effort; a missing source names relocation or revocation, never a scan; a replaced or truncated source is quarantined with its checkpoint frozen, and only your explicit re-enrollment adopts the new bytes." />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,2"
                                   Text="• Collections organize; they never grant. Added members never enter a frozen session scope, and an unknown member is refused instead of stored." />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,2"
                                   Text="• Preservation is explicit and scoped: one generation's exact bytes with the source revision it was taken from and the retention you chose. No transcript is migrated automatically and no profile is scanned." />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,2"
                                   Text="• Refresh reads only opted-in sources while unlocked; every other source names its skip reason with no read. Locking stops private reads and refresh." />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,2"
                                   Text="• Keyboard: Enter in a list opens the selected row, F5 in this view re-reads sources, collections and the refresh pass, Ctrl+L locks the vault." />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,2"
                                   Text="• Privacy: this view holds no on-disk cache and echoes no locator. Locking the vault (or losing the service, or ending the session) clears every source, collection, snapshot and draft above, and an answer already in flight is discarded instead of restoring them." />
                    </StackPanel>

