                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                                   Text="Run the model jobs that turn a saved note into reviewed proposals, see each job's real state, and configure the model/egress settings and the synthesis schedule you enable. Every value here is an answer of the running service: the service owns the job lifecycle, the encrypted provider configuration, the encrypted schedule record and every due check. Saving a note never calls a model; only your explicit run does." />

                        <TextBlock x:Name="JobsStateText" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,12,0,0" FontSize="16" />

