                                   Text="Provider, model and endpoint are external locator values from your own provider account: enter the provider label your service configuration uses, the exact model ID, and the API base URL (for an OpenAI-compatible API this is the base such as https://api.example.com). The key is sent once, stored encrypted and never shown again. These are not vault IDs and no picker can discover them." />
